      "startTime": 18.944,
      "endTime": 22.768,
      "text": "It’s useful, and my English teacher is really nice.",
      "words": ["It’s", "useful", "and", "my", "English", "teacher", "is", "really", "nice"],
      "translation": "它很有用，而且我的英语老师真的很好。",
      "wordCount": 9
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "startTime": 23.504,
      "endTime": 25.104,
      "text": "How about you, Binbin?",
