      "translation": "Binbin，你呢？",
      "wordCount": 4
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "startTime": 25.68,
      "endTime": 30.112,
      "text": "I like all the subjects, but my favourite is maths.",
      "words": ["I", "like", "all", "the", "subjects", "but", "my", "favourite", "is", "maths"],
      "translation": "我喜欢所有科目，但我最喜欢的是数学。",
      "wordCount": 10
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "startTime": 31.168,
      "endTime": 31.84,
      "text": "Why?",
      "words": ["Why"],
